<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 6	 Mar 5	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  269.750     268.300     247.020    9.20 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.500     304.500     306.830   -0.43 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.965     156.690     158.970   -1.26 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.546	46.450	47.182   -1.35 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  434.700     432.580     419.180    3.70 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.500     139.310     141.685   -1.54 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.792	15.728	16.185   -2.43 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  221.810     220.820     212.430    4.42 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.856	 1.855	 1.888   -1.69 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.560	 1.581   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.275     180.715     183.135   -1.02%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
